# Exact ordered steps: drain is a registered non-associative accumulator ((acc-x)⌈0), so its
# fold is lawful only as the exact left recurrence — the registry cannot prove regrouping for
# an undeclared law, which is why 12 5 0 0 is the one admissible scan.
n 8
col enemies bool 0 1 1 0 1 0 1 0
col damage nat 5 12 7 0 30 4 9 2
fn threat {𝕨⌈𝕩}
fn drain {(𝕨-𝕩)⌈0}
ja 敵勢 enemies
ja 損傷 damage
ja 脅威 threat
ja 消耗 drain
